cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "llm-judge-source-accuracy: source-dependent accuracy of LLM judges on physician-written and LLM-written hospital-course summaries"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code, aggregate results and analysis plan for a study of LLM judges on MIMIC-III-Ext-VeriFact-BHC:
  judge sensitivity and specificity by source, error of judge-only rates and differences across 126 judge
  settings, and simulated physician review comparing labels alone, Rogan-Gladen correction and prediction-powered
  inference within each source. No data from the credentialed dataset are included.
type: software
license: MIT
